  "name": "Slow Cooker Spanish Beef Stew",
  "subtitle": "Tender beef with potatoes, sofrito, and olives",
  "description": "A hearty Spanish-style stew combining browned beef, potatoes, tomatoes, sofrito, and green olives in a slow cooker.",
